{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Alchemy Deluxe,\u00a0</i>WildRise reinvents tile-matching with deeper strategic mechanics. As a forest guardian, you'll carefully place tiles to restore lifeless concrete biomes, where every move cascades across the board and wrong choices can block your path to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic tile-matching</strong> \u2014 Familiar mechanics, reimagined with depth and creativity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reclaim the wild</strong> \u2014 Restore forests, rivers, wetlands, volcanoes, and ancient ruins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bring back life</strong> \u2014 Watch birds, butterflies, and wildlife return as nature spreads</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving challenge</strong> \u2014 Easy to learn mechanics that demand strategic mastery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete experience</strong> \u2014 24 handcrafted levels, Impossible Mode, and Steam Achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning biomes</strong> \u2014 Each environment offers unique restoration challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone thinks they understand WildRise after the first few levels. The forest has other plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Help the world grow green again \u2014 one beautiful tile at a time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225790/extras/92a26a057f9dccbd041f21344250d685.avif?t=1759710298\" width=800 height=933 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Sprout","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3225790/b030171b3b246f77e1d1692911ac9eef2534f9c9.jpg"},{"name":"Nature Restored","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3225790/fd9861303a0d7ecfe5c6e2919ef2311c6e7ed88d.jpg"},{"name":"Seedling Starter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3225790/90d2072970ec7ca1e0b1c5e3a940fd5a2d6b27b9.jpg"},{"name":"Blooming Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3225790/ebd64dcda8019fa4911d40d48fbd98ca07316bd9.jpg"},{"name":"WildRise Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3225790/b8b6189853d874f386ec84e94effb0587c012da1.jpg"},{"name":"Flower Power","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3225790/5939436fb0426d18eb892ee8b29275834ae13efa.jpg"},{"name":"Blast Botanist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3225790/919499c5095db62842a5377f313595d6f6f6f012.jpg"},{"name":"Concrete Cracker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3225790/f8860508f3b281fe37d0bca3b07d584b401873f3.jpg"},{"name":"Nature Rises again","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3225790/fceb5db531ba47e53890f9912a38657ec156b158.jpg"},{"name":"First Renewal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3225790/cece2b32978e620b2d60a09886df25d9621351c2.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3225790?t=1759710298","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225790/0f32c718b75b1e1c38443780f3dba516302fea89/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759710298","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225790/c5c0d03d5598d24550612d6e5acf7f5dc4f65afd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759710298","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225790/c5c0d03d5598d24550612d6e5acf7f5dc4f65afd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759710298","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description